__Solstice Roots is an outdoor music event held on Saturday 20th December__

 _at Crystal Waters Community kicking off at 4pm until midnight. It is a family friendly showcase of local roots bands & artists aimed at bringing the community together to support original live music and celebrate the Summer Solstice._ 

_Solstice Roots 2014 will be headlined by two of Maleny's very own roots acts - Hayden Hack Infusion and Youngtree and will also feature Bearfoot, Almost Lazy, Ryan Delaney and Thicker than Water all based here on the Sunshine Coast as well as an all-star jam! There will be wholesome vegetarian food available, cake and chai, a bar and wood fired pizza's from Crystal Waters famous sourdough bakery. Entry is by donation._

_For more info check out the Facebook page: [facebook.com/solsticerootsfest](http://facebook.com/solsticerootsfest)_
